{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a12a51aabba35343ca46932b0964cbbe786512abfcc6a031648a9af37c147441", "ja": "（そろそろ765プロ劇場の初公演の時間だ。\n春香はちゃんと準備できてるだろうか？）", "zh": "（差不多要到765艺能剧场首次公演的时间了。\n春香已经做好准备了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4d1ba1a418276d26f0bf7c3fc28986a2cada228221b88dc34e3d433e49adae06", "ja": "春香、もうすぐ本番だぞ。\nスタンバイはできてるか……？", "zh": "春香，马上就要正式开始啰。\n你准备好了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "6bc546893ac2851e5c11a65721e822f78f5e7d41acfcb6ee0ff62940a758d181", "ja": "は、はい、大丈夫です！　バッチリ用意できてます！\n今日は任せてください……！", "zh": "好、好了，没问题！我已经做好万全准备！\n今天就放心交给我吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "e2ab3f11050cd32716e3898de9fdfc4565d7e929bf947dd7e56332d047b5d0cf", "ja": "新しい子達も見てますし……\n頑張らないとですよねっ。", "zh": "新人们也都在看……\n我得加油才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a22cd61f1e60c13b427301f5a9ad888f6eb0f6fab05afcf7300559bc3d690531", "ja": "（気合い充分だけど、雰囲気的に\nちょっとぎこちないのが気になるな……）", "zh": "（气势是很够，但感觉起来有点僵硬，\n让人放不下心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "9b805d075ceb276d16baf69fcee80b090fc9ef27fa0a5c22732308fbbba56931", "ja": "あ、そうだっ！　今日の公演の進行表、\nスタッフさんに確認しておいた方がいいですよね？", "zh": "啊，对了！今天公演的流程表，\n我是不是先跟工作人员确认一下比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "09cecfc1daa0584990669bed615a23d00a3235218a296d8ea15338ac059c8bb4", "ja": "私、ちょっと行ってきます！\n{$P$}さん、また後で……！", "zh": "我去看一下！\n{$P$}先生，等会见……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ce08313a53af4531bbf5cec427467173c16675bfc21da03f0d61e7f9a5bbf1d5", "ja": "あ、春香、ちょっと待……。", "zh": "啊，春香，等一……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1008_se", "source_sha256": "e42a2bea12c3b3ac0b85f9dae24c108871ec19aa65c31a8d4168a161aa5ef3ce", "ja": "どんがらがっしゃーん！！", "zh": "（摔了一跤）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "7b40ffe959043129293838932675d6ebffe7fc8c779d71a404658ad10704dde2", "ja": "きゃあ～！\nご、ごめんなさい！　ごめんなさ～いっ！", "zh": "呀啊～！\n对、对不起！对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "79a6c42d26b2087f793534c461814ac8594bcc25819b74546404246a11b6ba40", "ja": "は、春香！？　大丈夫か、春香ー！", "zh": "春、春香！？你没事吧？春香──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "a9460a73dd517408ee30365e26c27031d365024337d4240629fd361bb18ba9f8", "ja": "うう……スタッフさんに迷惑かけちゃいました。\nどうして私って、いつもこうなんだろう……。", "zh": "呜呜……给工作人员添麻烦了。\n为什么我总是会出这种包呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "62baae64615f78a1efafdd5bc6c1c1cb2c59e0c4e7f42b92ae8a2ff0a26327e0", "ja": "これじゃあ、みんなのお手本になんて\nなれないですよね……。うぅ……。", "zh": "这样怎么当得了大家的榜样……\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "44a7a058356c7b71171c05a3a72f87d5139befb0d229a956d524abbcd6275f0f", "ja": "（まずい。さっきのミスで、\n完璧に自信をなくしているな……）", "zh": "（糟糕，刚刚那一摔，\n让她彻底没了自信心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_1014", "source_sha256": "247fd436b83dbe338c03dbe34ef3987ceeb3a37c879723ccb360b576cff98705", "ja": "笑って励ます", "zh": "微笑鼓励她", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a398c8d18a283349cf4701bab94cfb48d15bc39d17013dbd17d9b44f1f138e1f", "ja": "そんなに気負わなくても大丈夫だよ。ほら、失敗したら\nしたで、みんなリラックスできるかもしれないしだろ？", "zh": "不用给自己那么大的压力，你想想嘛，\n说不定你出错，能让大家放松下来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "b63503528f77d16607daa1faf73ff64953533c809376993aa44afb45fd11d02b", "ja": "そ、そうですか？\n逆に硬くなったりもしそうですけど……。", "zh": "是、是吗？\n怎么感觉反而会让气氛更僵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "24708150599f338c27d0db498fbe01cda9147e4f6e4736d75fd9f1f34335951c", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。春香ならリカバリーできるだろ？\nそれはそれで、いいお手本になるから。", "zh": "不用担心啦，春香一定能够重新站起来的。\n那样也算是很好的示范呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2003_001har", "source_sha256": "2722aa81a6a663b17f2d8488796175b5d5250a59ea923bd24448d8ed7a12f0b9", "ja": "うう、他人事だと思って～。\n失敗した時点で恥ずかしいじゃないですかぁ……。", "zh": "呜呜，你就知道讲这种风凉话～\n当下出糗的我岂不是很丢脸嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "407e9514d799b20d70fb86f0d7b765dbb29469876d1a4e985f260244d7ce1a6b", "ja": "はは、ごめんごめん。\nでも、本当に思ってるんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉抱歉。\n不过，这些都是我的真心话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2005_p", "source_sha256": "5f79081e205aaf3f8d4d15a51b5d2ce2e322b4d65432434d4709d8aa72be2529", "ja": "失敗するにせよ、しないにせよ……。\n春香なら、なんとかしてくれるって。", "zh": "不管有没有出错……\n我相信春香一定都能跨过难关的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2006_001har", "source_sha256": "bb7e39d336b6ea5447367b2ef752971fd25468eb8f6b2d4bcc2c6a1dd1080ecd", "ja": "もう……。ふふっ、ずるいです、\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "真是的……呵呵，你讲这种话太犯规了，\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2007_001har", "source_sha256": "76ad36bb62f69f16aca175d8262ff816bbf5f2cb7e5280d3467ac964a4c9c553", "ja": "そこまで信じてるって言われたら……\n私、ますます頑張っちゃいますよ？", "zh": "听到你这么信任我……\n那我要更努力一些了唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2008_p", "source_sha256": "66643556c719f7d64672bfd11e5576572ff04fa3c92f389ddf09fbc3ac2ff243", "ja": "そうか？　それならそれでいいんだ。\n期待してるぞ！", "zh": "是吗？那样就好，\n我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2009_001har", "source_sha256": "1b0676540044cbc2a15fd65d457da449d79badb2cd666a6c69c4b9aa8f14841e", "ja": "はいっ、わかりました！\nどうなっても知りませんからね？", "zh": "是，我明白了！\n结果怎样我可不管喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2010_001har", "source_sha256": "08c52955d88fb91512f38316092e1ea565d55ba339ef6414b2c1eb6aaaefc343", "ja": "いつもの私のままで……\n天海春香のままで、行ってきます！", "zh": "我会做自己……\n展现天海春香的本色，登台演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2011_p", "source_sha256": "3915ce062667b106549bf119950d39f3a577eaa7363d6e76d72fc8403149dd0e", "ja": "（笑顔を見せて、ステージへ上がっていく姿は、\nいつもの信頼できる春香だ）", "zh": "（春香微笑走上舞台的身影，\n是平时那个可靠的她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_001har_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_001har_003_2012_p", "source_sha256": "7107a69c70f6b2cfd38d138b7784f25babbe28dedbcf08635cff97f4ae6a3923", "ja": "（その背中は、必ずみんなを、\n引っ張っていってくれることだろう）", "zh": "（我想她的背影，\n一定会带领大家朝目标前进。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
